    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +3</p><p>You identify unstable divinity: feral tulpas, corrupted contracts, rogue manifestations.</p><p>As an action, mark a target <strong>Out of Compliance</strong> for this scene.</p><h3>While Out of Compliance:</h3><ul><li><p>Your suppression, banishment, and disable effects:</p><ul><li><p>reroll the lowest die <strong>or</strong></p></li><li><p>Add your Tier to the DC (your choice)</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Violations of contracts or major precedents trigger Auditor features.</p></li></ul><p>Only one creature may be Out of Compliance at a time.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>No Surge required to mark.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Marking politically protected entities may generate backlash.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
